        },
        {
            "a": "Mistral Medium 3.5 is the newest version in the OpenRouter catalog, added on 2026-04-30.",
            "q": "What is the newest Mistral model?"
        },
        {
            "a": "Mistral versions accept file, image and text as input and produce text. 2 of the 12 versions support reasoning, and context windows run from 32,768 to 262,144 tokens.",
